# Journey to Windurst in Windurst Woods with three Parana Shields and a Bronze Dagger held, Mourices. Status 5: a trade
# of two Parana Shields draws no reply. Status 6: one shield, three shields, the dagger alone, and two shields with the
# dagger each draw no reply (the trade must be exactly two shields); two shields play 457, whose finish is run. At
# status 6 again a single shield draws no reply. The login in Windurst Woods also plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-
# in 839, whose finish sets SoA status 4.
